    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWithin walking distance of every town amenity, this lovely traditional street fronted town house promises convenience, character and privacy.Surprisingly spacious, its boasts include dual heating, double glazing and an enclosed patio yard with rear access.Viewings are invited by appointment.\n\nTo place an offer on this property, register for your mySherryFitz account at SherryFitz.ie.."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.204m x 1.860m\nUnderstair press. Carpeted stairs.\n\nLoung - 4.093m x 4.275m\nFireplace with stove and back boiler. Curtains and pole. Marley flooring.\n\nKitchen - 3.926m x 2.738m\nFitted floor and wall units. Integrated appliances. Marley flooring.\n\nBack Hall - 1.059m x 1.769m\nMarley flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.368m x 3.988m\nDownstairs. Carpeted. Fireplace. Curtain pole.\n\nBathroom - 2.241m x 1.728m\nToilet. Sink. Bath. Electric shower and screen over bath. Tiled floor and walls.\n\nLanding - 2.392m x 0.845m\nCarpeted.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.60m x 4.135m\nDouble. Carpeted. Double built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.304m x 2.599m\nSingle. Carpeted. Curtains and pole.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.135m x 3.484m\nDouble. Carpeted.\n\n"
      },
